SUMMARY:Jake Velazquez Special Taping Presented by the New York Comedy Fest
 ival
LOCATION:New York Comedy Club\, 241 East 24th Street\, New York
DESCRIPTION:Jake Velazquez is a New York-based stand-up comedian who was na
 med one of New York's Funniest in 2024 after being selected as a Comic to W
 atch in 2023. Last year\, he completed his first headlining tour\, performi
 ng in 15 cities. He's also been featured at comedy festivals including Skan
 kfest\, Big Sky\, and Red Clay. Over the past 4 years Jake has been the ope
 ning act for Jordan Jensen\, including on her debut Netflix special "Take M
 e With You" and her recent bus tour.A native New Yorker\, Jake only grew to
  be 5'6" because of the tiny spaces he was confined to with his five sister
 s\, Puerto Rican father\, and Jewish mother. His comedy blends edgy observa
 tions with stories that poke fun at his own insecurities and the embarrassi
 ng moments that come with living an unconventional life. He has been descri
 bed by many as "hilarious" and "smaller than expected in person."Presented 
 by the New York Comedy Festival.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy
 -atlas/event/jake-velazquez-special-taping-presented-by-the-new-york-comedy
 -festival/
